OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers proud of 19th Century
OL,4,Acottage renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers say they are immensely proud
OL,7,Fof their work transforming a 19th
OL,8,FCentury cottage built by Florence
OL,9,FNightingale's uncle.
OL,11,FAqueduct Cottage, near Cromford in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, was constructed as a
OL,13,Flock-keeper's home in 1802, with the
OL,14,Fnursing pioneer visiting as a child.
OL,16,FIt had been empty since 1970, but after
OL,17,Fa four-year restoration project it
OL,18,Fopened to visitors in March 2023.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
